{"title":"Resource library","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Resource library","page-layout":"full","execute":{"freeze":false,"cache":false}},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\nBrowse the resources below. The search field searches titles, authors, descriptions, and topics. The filters can be combined.\n\n```{r}\n#| results: asis\n#| echo: false\nresources <- withCallingHandlers(read.csv(\"resources.csv\", stringsAsFactors = FALSE, check.names = FALSE,\n                      fileEncoding = \"UTF-8\", na.strings = character()), warning = function(w) stop(conditionMessage(w), call. = FALSE))\nstopifnot(all(c(\"Title\", \"Author/creators\", \"Year\", \"Description\", \"Topics\", \"Format\", \"Link\") %in% names(resources)))\nresources[is.na(resources)] <- \"\"\nescape_html <- function(x) {\n  x <- as.character(x)\n  x <- gsub(\"&\", \"&amp;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub(\"<\", \"&lt;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub(\">\", \"&gt;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub('\"', \"&quot;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x\n}\nvalid_url <- function(x) grepl(\"^https?://\", x, ignore.case = TRUE)\nsplit_categories <- function(x) {\n  values <- trimws(unlist(strsplit(x, \";\", fixed = TRUE)))\n  sort(unique(values[nzchar(values)]))\n}\ntopics <- split_categories(resources$Topics)\nformats <- split_categories(resources$Format)\ncat('<div class=\"resource-tools\">')\ncat('<label for=\"resource-search\">Search resources</label>')\ncat('<input id=\"resource-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search titles, authors, descriptions...\" aria-label=\"Search resources\">')\ncat('<label for=\"topic-filter\">Topic</label><select id=\"topic-filter\"><option value=\"\">All topics</option>')\nfor (x in topics) cat(sprintf('<option value=\"%s\">%s</option>', escape_html(x), escape_html(x)))\ncat('</select><label for=\"format-filter\">Format</label><select id=\"format-filter\"><option value=\"\">All formats</option>')\nfor (x in formats) cat(sprintf('<option value=\"%s\">%s</option>', escape_html(x), escape_html(x)))\ncat('</select></div>')\ncat('<div class=\"library-toolbar\" id=\"library-toolbar\" hidden><div class=\"view-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Display layout\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"grid-view\" aria-pressed=\"true\">▦ Grid</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"list-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">☰ List</button></div><label>Sort by <select id=\"resource-sort\"><option value=\"title\">Title A–Z</option><option value=\"author\">Author A–Z</option><option value=\"newest\">Newest first</option><option value=\"oldest\">Oldest first</option><option value=\"original\">Original order</option></select></label><label>Per page <select id=\"page-size\"><option value=\"12\">12</option><option value=\"24\">24</option><option value=\"48\">48</option><option value=\"all\">All</option></select></label><button type=\"button\" id=\"clear-filters\">Clear filters</button></div>')\ncat(sprintf('<p id=\"resource-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">%s resources</p>', nrow(resources)))\ncat('<div id=\"resource-list\" class=\"resource-list\">')\nfor (i in seq_len(nrow(resources))) {\n  r <- resources[i, ]\n  searchable <- paste(r$Title, r$`Author/creators`, r$Description, r$Topics, r$Format, collapse = \" \")\n  cat(sprintf('<article class=\"resource-card\" data-search=\"%s\" data-topic=\"%s\" data-format=\"%s\" data-title=\"%s\" data-author=\"%s\" data-year=\"%s\">',\n              escape_html(tolower(searchable)), escape_html(r$Topics), escape_html(r$Format), escape_html(r$Title), escape_html(r$`Author/creators`), escape_html(r$Year)))\n  cat(sprintf('<div class=\"resource-formats\">%s</div>', escape_html(r$Format)))\n  cat(sprintf('<h3>%s</h3>', escape_html(r$Title)))\n  if (nzchar(r$`Author/creators`) || nzchar(r$Year)) cat(sprintf('<p class=\"resource-byline\">%s%s%s</p>', escape_html(r$`Author/creators`), if (nzchar(r$`Author/creators`) && nzchar(r$Year)) ' · ' else '', escape_html(r$Year)))\n  if (nzchar(r$Topics)) cat(sprintf('<p class=\"resource-meta\">%s</p>', escape_html(r$Topics)))\n  if (nzchar(r$Description)) cat(sprintf('<details class=\"resource-description\"><summary>About this resource</summary><p>%s</p></details>', escape_html(r$Description)))\n  if (valid_url(r$Link)) cat(sprintf('<p><a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original resource ↗</a></p>', escape_html(r$Link)))\n  else cat('<p class=\"missing-link\">Source link to be added</p>')\n  cat('</article>')\n}\ncat('</div><p id=\"no-results\" hidden>No matching resources. Try another search or filter.</p><nav id=\"resource-pagination\" aria-label=\"Resource pages\" hidden><button type=\"button\" id=\"prev-page\">Previous</button><span id=\"page-status\"></span><button type=\"button\" id=\"next-page\">Next</button></nav>')\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<script src=\"filter.js\"></script>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\nBrowse the resources below. The search field searches titles, authors, descriptions, and topics. The filters can be combined.\n\n```{r}\n#| results: asis\n#| echo: false\nresources <- withCallingHandlers(read.csv(\"resources.csv\", stringsAsFactors = FALSE, check.names = FALSE,\n                      fileEncoding = \"UTF-8\", na.strings = character()), warning = function(w) stop(conditionMessage(w), call. = FALSE))\nstopifnot(all(c(\"Title\", \"Author/creators\", \"Year\", \"Description\", \"Topics\", \"Format\", \"Link\") %in% names(resources)))\nresources[is.na(resources)] <- \"\"\nescape_html <- function(x) {\n  x <- as.character(x)\n  x <- gsub(\"&\", \"&amp;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub(\"<\", \"&lt;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub(\">\", \"&gt;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x <- gsub('\"', \"&quot;\", x, fixed = TRUE)\n  x\n}\nvalid_url <- function(x) grepl(\"^https?://\", x, ignore.case = TRUE)\nsplit_categories <- function(x) {\n  values <- trimws(unlist(strsplit(x, \";\", fixed = TRUE)))\n  sort(unique(values[nzchar(values)]))\n}\ntopics <- split_categories(resources$Topics)\nformats <- split_categories(resources$Format)\ncat('<div class=\"resource-tools\">')\ncat('<label for=\"resource-search\">Search resources</label>')\ncat('<input id=\"resource-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search titles, authors, descriptions...\" aria-label=\"Search resources\">')\ncat('<label for=\"topic-filter\">Topic</label><select id=\"topic-filter\"><option value=\"\">All topics</option>')\nfor (x in topics) cat(sprintf('<option value=\"%s\">%s</option>', escape_html(x), escape_html(x)))\ncat('</select><label for=\"format-filter\">Format</label><select id=\"format-filter\"><option value=\"\">All formats</option>')\nfor (x in formats) cat(sprintf('<option value=\"%s\">%s</option>', escape_html(x), escape_html(x)))\ncat('</select></div>')\ncat('<div class=\"library-toolbar\" id=\"library-toolbar\" hidden><div class=\"view-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Display layout\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"grid-view\" aria-pressed=\"true\">▦ Grid</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"list-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">☰ List</button></div><label>Sort by <select id=\"resource-sort\"><option value=\"title\">Title A–Z</option><option value=\"author\">Author A–Z</option><option value=\"newest\">Newest first</option><option value=\"oldest\">Oldest first</option><option value=\"original\">Original order</option></select></label><label>Per page <select id=\"page-size\"><option value=\"12\">12</option><option value=\"24\">24</option><option value=\"48\">48</option><option value=\"all\">All</option></select></label><button type=\"button\" id=\"clear-filters\">Clear filters</button></div>')\ncat(sprintf('<p id=\"resource-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">%s resources</p>', nrow(resources)))\ncat('<div id=\"resource-list\" class=\"resource-list\">')\nfor (i in seq_len(nrow(resources))) {\n  r <- resources[i, ]\n  searchable <- paste(r$Title, r$`Author/creators`, r$Description, r$Topics, r$Format, collapse = \" \")\n  cat(sprintf('<article class=\"resource-card\" data-search=\"%s\" data-topic=\"%s\" data-format=\"%s\" data-title=\"%s\" data-author=\"%s\" data-year=\"%s\">',\n              escape_html(tolower(searchable)), escape_html(r$Topics), escape_html(r$Format), escape_html(r$Title), escape_html(r$`Author/creators`), escape_html(r$Year)))\n  cat(sprintf('<div class=\"resource-formats\">%s</div>', escape_html(r$Format)))\n  cat(sprintf('<h3>%s</h3>', escape_html(r$Title)))\n  if (nzchar(r$`Author/creators`) || nzchar(r$Year)) cat(sprintf('<p class=\"resource-byline\">%s%s%s</p>', escape_html(r$`Author/creators`), if (nzchar(r$`Author/creators`) && nzchar(r$Year)) ' · ' else '', escape_html(r$Year)))\n  if (nzchar(r$Topics)) cat(sprintf('<p class=\"resource-meta\">%s</p>', escape_html(r$Topics)))\n  if (nzchar(r$Description)) cat(sprintf('<details class=\"resource-description\"><summary>About this resource</summary><p>%s</p></details>', escape_html(r$Description)))\n  if (valid_url(r$Link)) cat(sprintf('<p><a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View original resource ↗</a></p>', escape_html(r$Link)))\n  else cat('<p class=\"missing-link\">Source link to be added</p>')\n  cat('</article>')\n}\ncat('</div><p id=\"no-results\" hidden>No matching resources. Try another search or filter.</p><nav id=\"resource-pagination\" aria-label=\"Resource pages\" hidden><button type=\"button\" id=\"prev-page\">Previous</button><span id=\"page-status\"></span><button type=\"button\" id=\"next-page\">Next</button></nav>')\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<script src=\"filter.js\"></script>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":false,"freeze":false,"echo":false,"output":true,"warning":false,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,